<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia August palm oil export duties.</title>
<headline>Malaysia August palm oil export duties.</headline>
<text>
<p>(All quoted in ringgit/tonne)</p>
<p>Products		     Value		   Duty</p>
<p>				August   (July)	August (July)</p>
<p>Crude Palm Oil	    1,285.50 (1,333.82)  165.65 (180.15)</p>
<p>Processed Palm Oil	1,414.98 (1,424.62)  204.49 (207.38)</p>
<p>Palm Kernel Oil	     822.01 (  919.19)  176.41 (183.85)</p>
